### ==================== 6. 容量极限测试 ====================

### 6.1 创建一个小容量票型（每日限3人）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tourism/spots/{{spot_id}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "name": "VIP体验票",
  "description": "限量VIP，含专人导览",
  "price": 288.00,
  "category": "TICKET",
  "dailyCapacity": 3,
  "minQuantity": 1,
  "maxQuantity": 3,
  "advanceDays": 0
}

> {%
    client.global.set("ticket_vip", response.body.data.id);
%}

###

### 6.2 预约2张VIP票
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tourism/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tourist_token}}

{
  "ticketId": {{ticket_vip}},
  "visitDate": "2026-04-01",
  "quantity": 2,
  "contactName": "小王",
  "contactPhone": "13900001111"
}

> {%
